Infograph Sidebar
=================

This project is a fork of:

  shuuul/obsidian-infographic
  https://github.com/shuuul/obsidian-infographic
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Upstream provides AntV Infographic code-block rendering, export, and PDF snapshot support.

Fork additions:
  - LLM extraction of AntV Infographic DSL from note body
  - Sidebar ItemView with live preview, cache, regenerate, insert DSL
  - Configurable auto-generation policy and source-anchor navigation
  - Deploy script via INFOGRAPH_OBSIDIAN_PLUGIN_DIR

